				<wikidot:authorName>DesertMoonGW</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1439663</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Initial Report Date: January 03, 2020</p> </blockquote> <p>This hurts my brain a lot. <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-3984">SCP-3984</a> says that the End of Death Scenario hit on September 12th 2020, the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/omega-k">Omega-K</a> article indicates that dados Youth in Asia was made around October 3rd 2030 with the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-3866">SCP-3866</a> article basically stating that it was on April 2029/28/27/etc. So, following this article, MC&amp;D created a drug to solve a problem that wouldn't exist for another 8 months, using another drug that wouldn't exist for a decade as the base.</p> <p>Upvoting because good article of course, but please change this.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
